message: "Author information is TBD."
type: software
title: "Two-vertex certification of nonsingular sign-regular matrix intervals"
authors:
  - family-names: "TBD"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Two checker vertices certify nonsingular sign regularity of an entire
  real square entrywise matrix interval, in every positive dimension
  and for every signature. Includes the written proof, a complete Lean
  proof, and exact supporting checks. The manuscript license is TBD.
